  m_text: "<size=18>\n-  Award Symbol appears on reel 5 only. \n-  Award Symbol appears
    with Value which is proportional to player's Total Bet.\n-  Award Symbol on reel
    5 becomes a random symbol except Scatter and Wild Symbols.\n-  5 of a kind win
    with Award Symbol(s) on reel 5 pays the Value on Award Symbol(s). "
